#### 9. Assertion Roulette *(extended catalog)*

**Smell:** `CalculateTotal_ReturnsCorrectAmount` contains **3 assertions with no message parameters**. When one fails, MSTest reports only "Expected: X, Actual: Y" — you must read code to know which property was wrong.

